:: RobinTemple Bunk
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<set $wardrobe_location to 'temple'>>
<<bedclotheson 'RobinTemple Bed'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _robinHere to $RobinTemple.stage isnot 'none' and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and (Time.weekDay is 7 and Time.hour gte 21 or Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
<<set _robinAfternoon to ['member', 'approved', 'promised'].includes($RobinTemple.stage)
  and !$robinmissing and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and !Time.schoolDay and !Time.isWeekEnd()
  and Time.hour gte 13 and Time.hour lt 16>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Robin’s bunk stands near the end of a row. A folded blanket lies beneath a schoolbook, and a clean shirt hangs from the bedpost.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    罗宾的床铺靠近这一排的尽头。叠好的毯子上放着一本课本，床柱上挂着干净的衬衫。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('VP') and maplebirch.VP.realEstate.residenceOf('Robin')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin uses it during temple shifts. At night <<he>> returns to your home.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾值班时会用这张床，夜里则回到与你同住的家。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _robinHere>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      After the Saturday shift, Robin stays here until morning. <<He>> shifts aside when you approach, leaving room on the mattress.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      星期六的值班结束后，罗宾会在这里待到天亮。见你走近，<<he>>往旁边挪了挪，在床垫上给你留出位置。
  <</language>>
  <<if $robinromance is 1>>
    <br><br>
    <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '在床边陪罗宾坐一会儿 (0:15)' 'RobinTemple Bunk Talk'>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif _robinAfternoon>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is finishing the afternoon work list at the long table. The other initiates have gone to their duties. The space around <<his>> bunk is empty.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾在长桌旁核对下午的工作表。其他见习者都去做各自的事了，<<his>>床铺周围没有人。
  <</language>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $robinromance is 1
    and $RobinTemple.penance_day lt 0 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
    and $robin.timer.hurt is 0
    and (Time.hour lt 15 or Time.hour is 15 and Time.minute lt 45)>>
    <br><br>
    <<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '请罗宾到床边坐坐 (0:10)' 'RobinTemple Bed Afternoon'>><<pass 10>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and !$robinmissing and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is helping elsewhere in the quarters. <<His>> bunk is empty for now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾在宿舍别处帮忙，床铺暂时空着。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is away. The bed has been made, and the space beside it is quiet.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾不在。床铺已经整理好，旁边一片安静。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $earSlime.event and $earSlime.noSleep>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='red'>The slime will not let you sleep yet.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='red'>史莱姆现在不肯让你睡。</span>
  <</language>><br>
<<else>>
  <<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '脱衣钻进被窝' 'RobinTemple Bed'>><<undressSleep 'RobinTemple Bed'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<listsleepoutfits 'RobinTemple Bed'>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink '你的床铺' 'Temple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<wardrobeicon>><<lanLink '衣柜' 'Temple Wardrobe'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<icon 'mirror.png'>><<lanLink '镜子' 'Temple Mirror'>><<preMirror>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bunk Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if !$robinmissing and $robinromance is 1 and getRobinLocation() is 'temple'
  and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and (Time.weekDay is 7 and Time.hour gte 21 or Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin closes the schoolbook and rests against you. <<He>> talks about the day's work, then about a younger initiate who kept asking when morning would come.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾合上课本，靠在你身边。<<He>>先说起今天的生意，又说起一名总问天什么时候亮的年幼见习者。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "I told them it always does," <<he>> says. <<He>> stays close after the conversation ends.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “我告诉<<him>>，天总会亮的。”<<he>>说。话说完后，<<he>>依旧靠着你。
  <</language>>
  <<stress -3>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<lstress>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has already left for the day.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾已经离开了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '回到床边' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<effects>><<wearoutfit>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _robinHere to !$robinmissing and getRobinLocation() is 'temple'
  and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and (Time.weekDay is 7 and Time.hour gte 21 or Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
<<if _robinHere>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You settle beside Robin beneath the blanket. <<He>> waits for you to get comfortable before drawing it over both of you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你在毯子下挨着罗宾躺好。<<He>>等你安顿下来，才把毯子拉过你们两人。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin’s side of the bed is empty. You pull the blanket over yourself while the other initiates settle down.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾那侧空着。你盖上毯子，听着其他见习者渐渐安静下来。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<nightmareCheck 'RobinTemple Sleep'>>
<<generateSleepLinks 'RobinTemple Sleep'>>
<<if _robinHere and $robinromance is 1>>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '在毯子下吻罗宾' 'RobinTemple Bed Kiss'>><</lanLink>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Robin' 'kiss'>><br>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '问罗宾要不要你留下' 'RobinTemple Bed Invite'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink '起床' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><<storeon 'RobinTemple Bed'>><<loadTempHairStyle>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Kiss
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $robinromance is 1 and !$robinmissing and getRobinLocation() is 'temple'
  and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You kiss Robin beneath the blanket. <<He>> returns it softly, one hand closing around yours when the bunk creaks.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你在毯子下吻了罗宾。<<He>>轻轻回吻。床铺一响，<<he>>便握住你的手。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A neighbouring initiate turns over. You both wait until the room is quiet again.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      旁边的见习者翻了个身。你们等到屋里重新安静下来。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin lust 1>><br><br><<glove>><<glust>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is not beside you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾不在你身边。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink '躺回床上' 'RobinTemple Bed'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Invite
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $robinromance is 1 and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and (Time.weekDay is 7 and Time.hour gte 21 or Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin lifts the edge of the blanket. "You can stay," <<he>> whispers. "But ask me again if I seem worried. I will do the same for you."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾掀开毯子一角。“你可以留下，”<<he>>轻声说，“如果我看起来不安，再问我一遍。我也会这样对你。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '靠着罗宾睡' 'RobinTemple Bed Close'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<bedicon>><<lanLink '让罗宾先睡' 'RobinTemple Bed'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is not here now. You settle back beneath the blanket.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾现在不在。你重新躺回毯子下。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<bedicon>><<lanLink '躺回床上' 'RobinTemple Bed'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Bed Close
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You make room for Robin beneath the blanket. After a while <<his>> breathing slows. You can still hear the other initiates turning in their bunks.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在毯子下给罗宾挪出位置。过了一会儿，<<his>>的呼吸渐渐平稳。你仍能听见别的见习者在床上翻身。
<</language>>
<<stress -2>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<lstress>><<glove>>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink '继续睡觉' 'RobinTemple Sleep'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Sleep
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>>
<<set _requestedHours to $sleephour>>
<<set _robinHere to !$robinmissing and getRobinLocation() is 'temple'
  and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and (Time.weekDay is 7 and Time.hour gte 21 or Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
<<set _nightWake to _robinHere and $robinromance is 1 and _requestedHours gte 3
  and (Time.hour gte 21 or Time.hour lt 3)
  and $RobinTemple.night_day isnot Time.days
  and $nightmares lte 0 and random(1, 6) is 1>>
<<if _nightWake>>
  <!-- 睡前选定并保存场景，避免读档后重新抽取同一次夜醒事件。 -->
  <<set $RobinTemple.night_scene to Weather.precipitation is 'rain' ? 'rain'
    : $RobinTemple.vigil_result is 'passed' and random(1, 3) is 1 ? 'embers'
    : random(1, 3) is 1 ? 'ledger'
    : random(1, 2) is 1 ? 'voice' : 'blanket'>>
  <<set $sleephour to random(1, Math.min(2, _requestedHours - 1))>>
<</if>>
<<set $bedGuest to _robinHere ? 'Robin' : ''>>
<<set _autosavehere to true>><<sleep>>
<<if !_dreaming>>
  <<effects>><<wakingEffects $sleepHoursTotal>>
  <<set _nightWake to _nightWake and !$robinmissing
    and !_wakingEffect and $sleepHoursTotal gte 1
    and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
  <<if _nightWake>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.night_day to Time.days>>
    <<set $sleephour to Math.max(1, _requestedHours - $sleepHoursTotal)>>
    <<sleepeffects>>
    <<switch $RobinTemple.night_scene>>
      <<case 'rain'>><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Rain taps the high window. Robin is awake beside you, watching the water run down the glass.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          雨点敲着高处的窗。罗宾在你身边醒着，望着水痕顺玻璃流下。
      <</language>>
      <<case 'voice'>><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A voice from the next bunk wakes you. Robin has already pulled the fallen blanket back over the younger initiate.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          隔壁床传来的声音惊醒了你。罗宾已经替那名年幼的见习者盖好滑落的毯子。
      <</language>>
      <<case 'embers'>><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin wakes with a start. <<He>> stares at the dark ceiling as if the fire were still there.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾猛地醒来，盯着黑暗中的天花板，仿佛那堆火还在眼前。
      <</language>>
      <<case 'ledger'>><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A page turns beside you. Robin is awake with the business ledger open on <<his>> knees.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          身旁传来翻页声。罗宾还醒着，膝上摊着生意账本。
      <</language>>
      <<default>><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You wake when Robin tucks the blanket around your shoulder. <<He>> withdraws <<his>> hand, then notices your eyes are open.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾替你掖好肩上的毯子时，你醒了。<<He>>收回手，随后发现你正望着<<him>>。
      <</language>>
    <</switch>>
    <br><br>
    <<bedicon>><<lanLink '睁开眼' 'RobinTemple Night Wake'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif $nightmares gte 1 and $controlled is 0>>
    <<nightmareWake>>
  <<elseif !_wakingEffect>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You sleep beneath the temple’s quiet roof.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你在神殿安静的屋檐下睡了一觉。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<if !_nightWake>>
    <<sleepeffects>>
    <<set $wardrobe_location to 'temple'>><<wardrobeSelection true>><<radiooutfits>>
    <br><br>
    <<bedicon>><<lanLink '起床' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<set $phase to 0>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Night Wake
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<switch $RobinTemple.night_scene>>
  <<case 'rain'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin listens to the rain with you. "The roof at the orphanage leaks in weather like this," <<he>> says. "It is strange to lie still and not fetch a bucket."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾陪你听雨。“孤儿院的屋顶遇到这种天气会漏水，”<<he>>说，“躺着不去拿水桶，真有点不习惯。”
    <</language>>
  <<case 'voice'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin settles back beside you. "The child was dreaming about home," <<he>> whispers. "Jordan says the first nights can be difficult."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾重新在你身边躺下。“那孩子梦见家了，”<<he>>低声说，“约旦说，刚来的几晚会很难熬。”
    <</language>>
  <<case 'embers'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You remind Robin of the route out of the cloister. <<He>> names each door with you. When <<he>> reaches the last one, <<he>> lies back down.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你陪罗宾回忆离开回廊的路。<<He>>和你一起说出每扇门的位置。数到最后一扇，<<he>>重新躺了下来。
    <</language>>
  <<case 'ledger'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin has been working out what <<he>> can afford for the business next week. You point out that the figures will still be there in the morning. <<He>> closes the book and moves it out of the bed.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾正算下周还能给生意添些什么。你提醒<<him>>，账本明早也不会跑掉。<<He>>合上本子，把它从床上挪开。
    <</language>>
  <<default>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I thought you were cold," Robin whispers. <<He>> draws the blanket over both of you and waits for your breathing to slow.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我以为你冷，”罗宾轻声说。<<He>>把毯子盖在你们身上，等你的呼吸渐渐平稳。
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '握住罗宾的手' 'RobinTemple Night Wake Hand'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink '继续睡觉' 'RobinTemple Sleep'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink '起床' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><<set $sleephour to 0>><<storeon 'RobinTemple Bed'>><<loadTempHairStyle>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Night Wake Hand
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.night_scene is 'embers'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You find Robin's hand beneath the blanket. <<He>> holds on while you name the familiar sounds of the quarters, one by one.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你在毯子下握住罗宾的手。你一件件说起宿舍里熟悉的声音，<<he>>一直牵着你。
  <</language>>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.night_scene is 'ledger'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You take Robin's hand away from the closed ledger. <<He>> laughs quietly and settles beside you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你把罗宾的手从合上的账本边牵开。<<He>>轻声笑了笑，挨着你躺好。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You find Robin's hand beneath the blanket. <<He>> holds yours until the quarters are quiet again.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你在毯子下握住罗宾的手。<<He>>一直牵着你，直到宿舍再次安静下来。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<stress -2>><br><br><<glove>><<lstress>>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink '继续睡觉' 'RobinTemple Sleep'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink '起床' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><<set $sleephour to 0>><<storeon 'RobinTemple Bed'>><<loadTempHairStyle>><</lanLink>><br>
